2&oldid=110712828"},{"id":"22212:national:820b00ba45c9","cityId":"22212","category":"地域","text":"焼津市は、静岡県中部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%84%BC%E6%B4%A5%E5%B8%82&oldid=110712828"}],"22213":[{"id":"22213:national:846697b39ca1","cityId":"22213","category":"文化・名所","text":"市内に所在する各神社を中心に、さまざまな祭礼が行われています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%8E%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110787744"},{"id":"22213:national:e8cf0afcc689","cityId":"22213","category":"文化・名所","text":"市内には多数の神社が鎮座しており、人々の信仰を集めています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%8E%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110787744"},{"id":"22213:national:4b779b1c0f87","cityId":"22213","category":"地理・自然","text":"掛川市には粟ヶ岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%8E%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110787744"},{"id":"22213:national:d540eeb1722f","cityId":"22213","category":"地理・自然","text":"掛川市には小笠山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%8E%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110787744"},{"id":"22213:national:abaf88efce76","cityId":"22213","category":"地域","text":"掛川市は、静岡県の遠州地方（県西部）にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%8E%9B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=110787744"}],"22214":[{"id":"22214:national:16bc92127786","cityId":"22214","category":"地理・自然","text":"藤枝市には高根山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%97%A4%E6%9E%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=111214902"},{"id":"22214:national:c1874aa798a7","cityId":"22214","category":"地理・自然","text":"藤枝市には菩提山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%97%A4%E6%9E%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=111214902"},{"id":"22214:national:55cff782e289","cityId":"22214","category":"地域","text":"藤枝市は、静岡県中部（駿遠地域）にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%97%A4%E6%9E%9D%E5%B8%82&oldid=111214902"}],"22215":[{"id":"22215:national:2723617fde41","cityId":"22215","category":"地理・自然","text":"御殿場市は富士山と箱根の弓状の裾野に広がる高原に位置しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.o